/2019d1q/201909/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1255746, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "2019年第1期", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/t20190104_1255746.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位：\n　　近年来我市危险化学品企业发展迅速，特别是氟化工产业迅猛发展，福建三农新材料有限责任公司、福建省三钢（集团）三明化工有限责任公司等企业转型升级，三明市海斯福化工有", "docabstract": "加强危险化学品企业安全生产监管", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/t20190104_1255746.htm", "docreltime": "2019.01.04 15:16:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于进一步加强危险化学品企业安全生产监管的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "明政办〔2018〕124号", "idxid": "SM00101-1200-2018-00924", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2018.12.29 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府办公室", "recid": 1407490, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/t20190104_1255746.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "明政办124号附件：三明市危险化学品生产安全事故应急预案.doc", "appdocid": 1255746, "appfile": "P020190104555898259653.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/t20190104_1255746.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0201901/P020190104/P020190104555898259653.doc", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/P020190104555898259653.doc"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1255693, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "2019年第1期", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/t20190104_1255693.htm", "content": "\n\n各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位：\n　　为贯彻党的十九大和十九届二中、三中全会精神，按照《三明市机构改革方案》确定的原则，平稳有序调整市政府规章规定的行政机关职责和工作，确保行政机关依法履行职责、开", "docabstract": "行政机关职责调整问题", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/t20190104_1255693.htm", "docreltime": "2019.01.04 14:22:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府关于机构改革涉及市政府规章规定的行政机关职责调整问题的决定", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "明政〔2018〕21号", "idxid": "SM00100-0100-2018-00921", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2018.12.29 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府", "recid": 1407488, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/t20190104_1255693.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fggzhgfxwj/201901/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1255692, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "2019年第1期", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/201901/t20190104_1255692.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位：\n现将《三明市主动融入闽西南协同发展区建设行动计划（2018—2020年）》印发给你们，请认真组织实施。\n \n \n三明市人民政府\n2018年12月28日\n（此件主动公开）\n\n三明市主动融入闽", "docabstract": "闽西南协同发展区建设行动计划", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/201901/t20190104_1255692.htm", "docreltime": "2019.01.04 14:11:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府关于印发三明市主动融入闽西南协同发展区建设行动计划（2018—2020年）的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明政〔2018〕20号", "idxid": "SM00100-0300-2018-00920", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2018.12.28 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府", "recid": 1407487, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/201901/t20190104_1255692.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/201901/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1255690, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "2019年第1期", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fpjyylshbzcjjydfmdzccsjqssqk/201901/t20190104_1255690.htm", "content": "    \n各县（市、区）人民政府，市直各单位：\n为深入贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想和党的十九大精神，巩固提升全市小微企业创业创新示范建设水平，打造“双创”升级版，推动万家小微企业创新创业高质量发展，", "docabstract": "万家小微企业创新创业", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fpjyylshbzcjjydfmdzccsjqssqk